---
/**
 * Architecture diagram for the Pachanga Community case study.
 *
 * Hand-authored SVG: no runtime, no external request, and readable text for
 * search engines and agents. The page repeats the same structure as text, so
 * the diagram is never the only place the information lives.
 *
 * The styles live in their own stylesheet, linked below: a `<style>` block here
 * would ride along with every page whose body registry reaches this component.
 */
import pachangaDiagramStyles from "../styles/pachanga-diagram.css?url";
---

<link id="pachanga-diagram-link" rel="stylesheet" href={pachangaDiagramStyles} />
<figure id="pachanga-diagram-pd" class="pd-diagram">
  <div id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll" class="pd-scroll">
    <svg id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-svg"
      viewBox="0 0 900 560"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="pd-title pd-desc"
      preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMin meet"
    >
      <title id="pd-title">Arquitectura de Pachanga Community</title>
      <desc id="pd-desc">
        A la izquierda, el flujo de datos: la app de Expo Router y sus pantallas llaman a
        hooks de dominio, que llaman a casos de uso; los casos de uso dependen de puertos y
        los adaptadores los implementan contra Supabase. A la derecha, las capas de Atomic
        Design: particles, atoms, molecules, organisms, layouts y screens.
      </desc>

      <defs id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-defs">
        <marker
          id="pd-arrow"
          viewBox="0 0 10 10"
          refX="8"
          refY="5"
          markerWidth="7"
          markerHeight="7"
          orient="auto-start-reverse"
        >
          <path id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-arrowhead" d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="pd-arrowhead" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <!-- Flow: app -->
      <g id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-g">
        <rect id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-box" class="pd-box" x="24" y="30" width="560" height="64" rx="8" />
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-title" class="pd-title" x="44" y="57">src/app/ · Expo Router</text>
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-sub" class="pd-sub" x="44" y="78">
          rutas por fichero; cada pantalla vive en src/ui/screens/
        </text>
      </g>

      <line id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-line" class="pd-line" x1="304" y1="98" x2="304" y2="106" marker-end="url(#pd-arrow)" />

      <!-- Flow: hooks -->
      <g id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-g-2">
        <rect id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-box-2" class="pd-box" x="24" y="110" width="560" height="64" rx="8" />
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-title-2" class="pd-title" x="44" y="137">Hooks de dominio</text>
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-sub-2" class="pd-sub" x="44" y="158">
          estado derivado; la pantalla no conoce de dónde vienen los datos
        </text>
      </g>

      <line id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-line-2" class="pd-line" x1="304" y1="178" x2="304" y2="186" marker-end="url(#pd-arrow)" />

      <!-- Flow: use cases -->
      <g id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-g-3">
        <rect id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-box-3" class="pd-box pd-box--core" x="24" y="190" width="560" height="64" rx="8" />
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-title-3" class="pd-title" x="44" y="217">Casos de uso · domain/**/use-cases</text>
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-sub-3" class="pd-sub" x="44" y="238">
          una regla por caso, con sus pruebas; TypeScript puro y Zod
        </text>
      </g>

      <line id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-line-3" class="pd-line" x1="304" y1="258" x2="304" y2="266" marker-end="url(#pd-arrow)" />

      <!-- Flow: ports -->
      <g id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-g-4">
        <rect id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-box-4" class="pd-box" x="24" y="270" width="560" height="64" rx="8" />
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-title-4" class="pd-title" x="44" y="297">Puertos · I*Port</text>
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-sub-4" class="pd-sub" x="44" y="318">
          el contrato que el dominio necesita, sin saber quién lo cumple
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- Domain boundary -->
      <line id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-boundary" class="pd-boundary" x1="24" y1="352" x2="584" y2="352" />
      <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-boundary-label" class="pd-boundary-label" x="24" y="372">frontera del dominio</text>

      <!-- Adapters implement ports: arrow climbs back into the domain -->
      <line id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-line-4" class="pd-line" x1="304" y1="376" x2="304" y2="340" marker-end="url(#pd-arrow)" />

      <!-- Flow: adapters -->
      <g id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-g-5">
        <rect id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-box-5" class="pd-box" x="24" y="380" width="560" height="64" rx="8" />
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-title-5" class="pd-title" x="44" y="407">Adaptadores · src/adapter</text>
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-sub-5" class="pd-sub" x="44" y="428">
          Supabase · in-memory · MMKV · TanStack Query · navegación · notificaciones
        </text>
      </g>

      <line id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-line-5" class="pd-line" x1="304" y1="448" x2="304" y2="456" marker-end="url(#pd-arrow)" />

      <!-- Flow: infrastructure -->
      <g id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-g-6">
        <rect id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-box-6" class="pd-box pd-box--soft" x="24" y="460" width="560" height="64" rx="8" />
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-title-6" class="pd-title" x="44" y="487">Supabase · red</text>
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-sub-6" class="pd-sub" x="44" y="508">
          PostgreSQL, autenticación y sincronización con el dispositivo
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- Atomic Design -->
      <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-panel" class="pd-panel" x="612" y="30">UI · Atomic Design</text>

      <g id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-g-7">
        <rect id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-pill" class="pd-pill" x="612" y="44" width="268" height="40" rx="20" />
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-pill-text" class="pd-pill-text" x="746" y="69">particles</text>
      </g>
      <line id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-line-6" class="pd-line" x1="746" y1="86" x2="746" y2="94" marker-end="url(#pd-arrow)" />

      <g id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-g-8">
        <rect id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-pill-2" class="pd-pill" x="612" y="98" width="268" height="40" rx="20" />
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-pill-text-2" class="pd-pill-text" x="746" y="123">atoms</text>
      </g>
      <line id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-line-7" class="pd-line" x1="746" y1="140" x2="746" y2="148" marker-end="url(#pd-arrow)" />

      <g id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-g-9">
        <rect id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-pill-3" class="pd-pill" x="612" y="152" width="268" height="40" rx="20" />
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-pill-text-3" class="pd-pill-text" x="746" y="177">molecules</text>
      </g>
      <line id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-line-8" class="pd-line" x1="746" y1="194" x2="746" y2="202" marker-end="url(#pd-arrow)" />

      <g id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-g-10">
        <rect id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-pill-4" class="pd-pill" x="612" y="206" width="268" height="40" rx="20" />
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-pill-text-4" class="pd-pill-text" x="746" y="231">organisms</text>
      </g>
      <line id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-line-9" class="pd-line" x1="746" y1="248" x2="746" y2="256" marker-end="url(#pd-arrow)" />

      <g id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-g-11">
        <rect id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-pill-5" class="pd-pill" x="612" y="260" width="268" height="40" rx="20" />
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-pill-text-5" class="pd-pill-text" x="746" y="285">layouts</text>
      </g>
      <line id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-line-10" class="pd-line" x1="746" y1="302" x2="746" y2="310" marker-end="url(#pd-arrow)" />

      <g id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-g-12">
        <rect id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-pill-6" class="pd-pill pd-pill--screens" x="612" y="314" width="268" height="40" rx="20" />
        <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-pill-text-6" class="pd-pill-text pd-pill-text--screens" x="746" y="339">screens</text>
      </g>

      <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-note" class="pd-note" x="612" y="386">
        Cada capa compone la anterior y solo
      </text>
      <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-note-2" class="pd-note" x="612" y="404">
        habla con la de al lado. Un cambio
      </text>
      <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-note-3" class="pd-note" x="612" y="422">
        visual no toca la lógica.
      </text>
      <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-note-4" class="pd-note" x="612" y="458">
        Las pantallas llaman a los hooks
      </text>
      <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-note-5" class="pd-note" x="612" y="476">
        de dominio: la UI no habla con
      </text>
      <text id="pachanga-diagram-pd-scroll-note-6" class="pd-note" x="612" y="494">
        Supabase directamente.
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="pachanga-diagram-pd-figcaption">
    Flujo real del proyecto: pantalla → hook de dominio → caso de uso → puerto ← adaptador
    → Supabase. El dominio no importa React Native, Expo ni la base de datos; por eso se
    prueba sin infraestructura.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

